## Why This Is Asked
OTCA cross-region data governance and real-time ML readiness, testing ability to design end-to-end with privacy and auditing.

## Key Concepts
- Residency and isolation
- Local DP budgeting
- Data modeling for signals
- Streaming topology with per-region topics
- Immutable stores and audits

## Code Example
